+| Actor capability | Legitimate decision / action | When unavailable or blocked |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Package admission authority | Inspect and admit the exact package/dependency scope | Ordinary users can inspect their permitted status and identify the accountable maintainer; they cannot bypass admission |
